Z||000000||koolgtz||11-13-2001||05:58 PM||||I was driving home from west palm bch back to miami on the turnpike; when I heard a knocking sound coming from the engine. It started out as a light sound. I know it was a rod because I had that problem before. This time I couldn't just park it cause I was thirty plus miles from home. <BR>I made the decision that I was going to baby it home,so I took it slow. I got as far as Margate then it started to get louder and the knocking got heavier. To make a long sad story short, I got home and I'm undecided about the Beretta And worst yet My Fiero  isn't ready for the road. All I know was today was a sad day.||||reg||9
